TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_PostApoc_UnauthorizedSalvage.option2.outcome0.Detail=<skip/>
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_PostApoc_UnauthorizedSalvage.option2.outcome1=수거업자들이 오래된 책을 찾아냅니다.
